<title>CHINA: UBS LAUNCHES WARRANTS ON CHINA RESOURCES.</title>
<headline>UBS LAUNCHES WARRANTS ON CHINA RESOURCES.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland's Hong Kong branch said on Wednesday it launched 66.8 million American-style call warrants on China Resources Enterprises Ltd. Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE     HK$34.92	PREMIUM	  20.12 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	HK$1.1686     GEARING	  3.32x</p>
<p> MATURITY	   29.JUN.98     PAYMENT DATE   01.SEPT.97</p>
<p> LISTING	    HONG KONG     LISTING DATE   03.SEPT.97</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE   HK$38.80	BOARD LOT	20,000</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong News Room (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
